{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2026-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1778198400, "end_date": 1778889599, "month_true_total": 81, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:08:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "225611752", "author": {"steamid": "76561198316183692", "personaname": "Just Thunk About It?", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/justthunkaboutit/", "num_games_owned": 593, "num_reviews": 147, "playtime_forever": 451, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 451, "last_played": 1778885569, "avatar": "1426f9647786a8203fbf4ac79d61ae6de8dcfdc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game! The story is rather simple and straightforward, which i think is a positive trait most of the time. The enjoyment of waves of enemies flying at you and the power you feel as an Ultra Marine is great! The combat feels great if not slightly janky at times, bt that's what you get for these types of games. Reminds me of the wolfenstein titles or Gears of War i grew up on. I wish the lore was heavier though. There are voice logs throughout the campaign but most immerse you in characters thoughts while not divulging much of the Warhammer lore. They are still much appreciated, just wish we had more background on enemies and factions. Overall great game! Can't wait to play the second.", "timestamp_created": 1778885748, "timestamp_updated": 1778885748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15141", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 7600X3D 6-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 9070", "vram_size": 16200}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225605635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026551804", "personaname": "kennykiniff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198026551804/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1814, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1692, "last_played": 1785292663, "avatar": "4c76064be169987500e4c7e228aabe3e33e1df47"}, "language": "english", "review": "amazing game", "timestamp_created": 1778880646, "timestamp_updated": 1778880646, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225499981", "author": {"steamid": "76561198398919080", "personaname": "Darth Bane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198398919080/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 658, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 610, "last_played": 1779075341, "avatar": "e4663e578d1bef5e6e1eb5100e0f0dd05386f57f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, think Gears of War but replace cover mechanics with melee combat. If you know 40k the story, characters, and setting are spot on.", "timestamp_created": 1778787799, "timestamp_updated": 1778787799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225483861", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971156356", "personaname": "Pill", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MandBoy/", "num_games_owned": 347, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 432, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 432, "last_played": 1770579824, "avatar": "6f075c45616edff214320f50bc3c281fbe539d26"}, "language": "english", "review": "5/10\n\nToo short, but okay.", "timestamp_created": 1778776193, "timestamp_updated": 1778776193, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225471507", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110035366", "personaname": "epudds", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/epudds/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 2318, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2318, "deck_playtime_at_review": 149, "last_played": 1778715725, "avatar": "dae98bf445206797c9c732eab5bee69fa801b0c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think Spacemarine was my first exposure to Warhammer 40K back in the 2010s. I remember playing it a bunch on xbox360 then when I got my first PC I bought it on steam. The Anniversary update improved playability on more modern systems and revived aspects of the multiplayer but I feel like you take more damage the higher your frame rate and monitor's refresh rate, I have no actually data to back it up it's just vibes, but I do know I've seen more visual bugs when you're playing above 60fps in the 120s and higher.\r\n\r\nAnyway, game is still a ton of fun, great intro to the universe of WH40K if you're looking for an entry point. The second game is better in just about every way but this game is important if you care about the narrative.", "timestamp_created": 1778766124, "timestamp_updated": 1778766124, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}